.TH KEGG 1 2000-1月 "compound_set" "compound_set"
.SH NAME
compound_set \- Get the kegg compound set from a kegg pathway map collection.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIcompound_set(\fBmaps\fR as any, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Get the kegg compound set from a kegg pathway map collection.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBmaps\fB \fR\- 
 a collection of the KEGG pathway [Map](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Assembly.KEGG.WebServices.XML.Map) object.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a \fBlist\fR object, the name of each slot is the KEGG map id and the value is a named
 list of the compound set (the name is the compound id and the value is the compound name)
 of that map.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
kegg
